    rdfs:comment "Lays down rules for conformity assessment procedures for high-risk AI systems, including assessment of compliance with all applicable requirements of the Regulation. Notes: Art. 43 is an assurance gate: map notions/metrics as acceptance criteria and test evidence; map mitigations as controls whose presence/configuration/effectiveness must be demonstrable and traceable to the assessed system version (including regression evidence after changes)." ;
    core:isOperationalizedBy indiv:Calibration,
