    ns1:SIO_000068 core:EU_AI_Act ;
    rdfs:comment "Requires that high-risk AI systems are designed with automatic logging capabilities to record events relevant for performance monitoring and compliance, including behaviour affecting fundamental rights. Notes: Observability layer: logs enable traceability of system behaviour across versions and contexts and support monitoring and audit activities; however, fairness monitoring requires additional design choices to ensure that logs capture relevant signals for bias detection and drift analysis, which are not fully specified by the Regulation" ;
