        core:ObservationalFairnessNotion,
        core:SeparationFairnessNotion ;
    rdfs:comment "examples from different groups MAY have different distributions of risk, and directly applying equality of opportunity over these different risks can raise  issues. Equivalent to False negative error balance because TPR=1-FNR" ;
